      "cooked": "<p>I know that Sentinels and Spirit Island each have their own wikis but is there anything for Bottom of the 9th? I haven’t been able to find anything. I know Bot9 is a smaller game but I’d hate to see the game disappear with the shuttering of GTG. It would be great if stats and/or images from the catalog of the game could be preserved somewhere.</p>",
