      "created_at": "2025-04-19T20:41:41.723Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The base game is available from Handelabra on Steam, and for only a dollar too.</p>\n<p>The expansions are dicier, though. I own the retail Sentinels of the Ninth expansion (there were some convention-exclusive promos but I don’t have access to them) and could work on trying to make screenshots if you want.</p>\n<p>Other than that, maybe someone who owns the other expansions could make also some scans for you.</p>",
